# Client UI

Full spec: `AGENTS.md` → Frontend.

## Tokens

Define colors, radius, fonts, and semantic spacing in `client/src/index.css` via `@theme`. Components use token utilities (`bg-surface`, `text-fg`, `rounded-md`), not `bg-blue-500`.

Layout utilities (`flex`, `grid`, `gap-4`) are fine.

## Component layers

Same composition rules as a design system. Folder names are ordinary:

```
client/src/components/ui/         # Button, Input, Text, Icon, Spinner
client/src/components/patterns/   # FormField, SearchBar, NavItem
client/src/components/sections/   # Header, Sidebar, LoginForm
```

- **ui**: one primitive. No routes, no API, no feature imports.
- **patterns**: a few `ui` pieces together. Local UI state only.
- **sections**: a full block (header, form, table). Data via props.
- **pages**: wire sections to routes and data.

Do not copy the same button/input markup into a second file. Put it in `ui`.

## Routing

Use `react-router-dom`. Route table in `client/src/config/routes.ts`.

- Layout routes render `<Outlet />`.
- Auth gates are wrappers (`ProtectedRoute` / `PublicRoute`) that render `<Outlet />` or `<Navigate />`.
- Pages do not embed a second router.

## Wrappers + config

`client/src/config/ui.ts` owns nav items, page titles, and layout flags. Header/sidebar read config; they do not hardcode the app map.

```tsx
// BAD
<button className="bg-blue-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg">Save</button>

// GOOD
<Button variant="primary">Save</Button>
```
